($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 11004318, $f$When the Pale Swan Cries$f$, ARRAY[$f$EldritchMage$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Bard/Thranduil if you shut one eye and cross the other$f$, $f$Barduil if you shut one eye and cross the other$f$, $f$The Hobbit - All Media Types$f$, $f$The Hobbit (Jackson Movies)$f$, $f$The Hobbit - J. R. R. Tolkien$f$, $f$Barduil - Fandom$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$I haven't written any angst in a long time, so here's a dark tale of a white-haired Swan in a cage, and a lonely man who goes into a bar to watch a hockey game. It's one more example of how no good deed goes unpunished.$f$, 7371, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-08-23T11:31:19.345+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-23T11:31:19.379+00:00$f$, $f$2017-05-26T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
